WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:04,150
Sister's unwavering loyalty

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,750
Boss Bai Xia was so kind to him

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,750
Drink more hot water and take care of yourself

4
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,150
yes yes yes

5
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,950
I will do it every day

6
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:14,520
Thank you boss

7
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,520
Okay, everyone, go back

8
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,980
The rest of the alliance

9
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,780
Radar and Chadar systems are watching him.

10
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,140
Can't run away

11
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:24,340
It doesn't hurt to give him a little freedom

12
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:29,320
We have to go to Mainland China to perform there.

13
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:33,770
Nice new clothes

14
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:40,050
For your grandpa

15
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:41,450
Doesn't he like to eat?

16
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:44,030
So much for leaving
